          "author": "advasileva",
          "created_at": "2023-02-16T22:03:29Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-02-16T22:04:51Z",
          "body": "This transformation applies with the `StEndless` decorator:\r\n```java\r\n.with(new StClasspath(\"/org/eolang/speco/1-1-coping.xsl\"))\r\n.with(new StEndless(new StClasspath(\"/org/eolang/speco/1-2-specialization.xsl\"))) // This one\r\n.with(new StClasspath(\"/org/eolang/speco/1-3-extension.xsl\"))\r\n.with(new StClasspath(\"/org/eolang/speco/2-1-substitute-applications.xsl\"));\r\n```\r\nSo I need to add some flag to the test `.yaml` config. Maybe this problem has been encountered in other projects and there is a config format for specifying the decorators with which the transformation is applied? I can come up with my own, but it seems that it is better to unify it.",
          "url": "https://github.com/objectionary/speco/issues/53#issuecomment-1433777490",
          "id": 1433777490
        },
